          "text": "YANG Su-yün 楊素蘊 (T. 筠湄, H. 退菴, 1630–1689), official, was a native of I-chün, Shensi. Made a chin-shih in 1652, he was appointed magistrate of Tung-ming, Chihli, in the following year.",
